        "zh": {
          "title": "澳洲航空取消3條波音787國際航線",
          "summary": "澳洲航空調整長程機隊配置；取消3條波音787國際航線並移出雪梨服務",
          "body": [
            "澳洲航空（Qantas）宣佈調整旗下長程機隊配置，決定取消 3 條使用波音 787（Boeing 787）客機營運的國際航線。根據相關規劃，這項營運調整將直接改變該公司未來的整體運能與國際航線排程。",
            "在此次長程機隊的重新調配過程中，澳洲航空將把 Dreamliner 客機移出布里斯本（Brisbane）與雪梨（Sydney）的相關航班服務。此舉將進一步調整相關航線的客運載運量與具體的飛行路線規劃。"
          ]
        },
        "en": {
          "title": "Qantas Cancels 3 International Boeing 787 Routes",
          "summary": "Qantas reshuffles long-haul fleet; cancels three Boeing 787 routes and alters Brisbane and Sydney services.",
          "body": [
            "Qantas is reshuffling its long-haul aircraft fleet, leading to the cancellation of three international routes operated by Boeing 787 Dreamliner aircraft. The operational adjustment is expected to alter the carrier's broader international routing plans and overall seat capacity distribution across its long-haul network.",
            "As part of the fleet deployment changes, Qantas will remove Boeing 787 Dreamliners from services operating out of Brisbane and Sydney. The strategic relocation of these widebody aircraft directly impacts existing flight schedules and capacity routing plans for the affected international departures."
          ]
        },
